{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/called-in-decision-heath-business-and-technical-park-heath-road-south-runcorn-cheshire-ref-3352472-9-march-2026","content_id":"d0c63399-280f-4c11-86eb-f72ba835f2f3","description":"Decision letter and Inspector’s Report for a called-in application.","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternativeformats@communities.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"69aee50ad620c14fa183eeed","filename":"260309_Combined_DL_IR_RtoC__redacted_versions__Heath_Business_Park__Runcorn__3352472__Redacted.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":14463411,"filename":"260309_Combined_DL_IR_RtoC__redacted_versions__Heath_Business_Park__Runcorn__3352472__Redacted.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9174395","isbn":"","number_of_pages":108,"title":"Called-in decision: Heath Business and Technical Park, Heath Road South, Runcorn, Cheshire (ref: 3352472 - 9 March 2026)","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69aee50ad620c14fa183eeed/260309_Combined_DL_IR_RtoC__redacted_versions__Heath_Business_Park__Runcorn__3352472__Redacted.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>Decision letter and Inspector’s Report, with redactions, for a called-in application for:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>up to 545 residential units including dwellinghouses (use class C3) and senior living and extra care (use class C2) with ancillary car and cycle parking</li>\n  <li>ancillary floorspace for flexible E use classes (including office, conference centre, retail, leisure [including food and beverage]), F2 use classes (including meeting places for the local community), and a hotel (use class C1)</li>\n  <li>sui generis use classes including STEAM spaces, a drinking establishment and a vertical farm</li>\n  <li>the principle of highways access and servicing arrangements</li>\n  <li>infrastructure provision, inclusive of a new living machine (emerging wastewater treatment technology), and all other associated works including re-configuration of existing building on site, landscaping, public realm, and biodiversity improvements,\nin accordance with application ref 22/00569/OUT, dated 23 March 2024.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>The unredacted decision letter and Inspector’s Report were sent only to parties listed in Schedule 2 of the s.321 direction. Further information is provided at paragraph 5 of the decision letter.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-09T15:30:01Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","documents":["<section data-module=\"ga4-link-tracker\" class=\"gem-c-attachment govuk-!-margin-bottom-6\">\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail govuk-!-display-none-print\">\n    <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-ga4-link=\"{&quot;event_name&quot;:&quot;file_download&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;attachment&quot;}\" href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69aee50ad620c14fa183eeed/260309_Combined_DL_IR_RtoC__redacted_versions__Heath_Business_Park__Runcorn__3352472__Redacted.pdf\">\n        <svg class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail-image gem-c-attachment__thumbnail-image--pdf\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 99 140\">\n  <path d=\"M12,59h9v9h-9v-9ZM30,77v9h39v-9H30ZM30,104h57v-9H30v9ZM30,122h48v-9H30v9ZM12,86h9v-9h-9v9ZM12,122h9v-9h-9v9ZM12,104h9v-9h-9v9ZM30,68h57v-9H30v9ZM35.2,21c-.3-.2-.6-.4-1-.5s-.8-.2-1.3-.2h-2.6v5.5h2.6c.5,0,1,0,1.3-.2s.7-.3,1-.5c.3-.2.5-.5.7-.8s.2-.7.2-1.1h0c0-.5,0-.9-.2-1.2-.2-.3-.4-.6-.7-.8h0ZM52.4,21.9c-.4-.5-1-.9-1.6-1.1-.7-.3-1.5-.4-2.4-.4h-2.7v11.5h2.7c.9,0,1.7-.1,2.4-.4s1.2-.7,1.6-1.1c.4-.5.7-1.1.9-1.7.2-.7.3-1.4.3-2.1v-.7c0-.8,0-1.5-.3-2.1-.2-.6-.5-1.2-.9-1.7h0ZM87,12v27H12V12h75ZM39.8,23c0-.9-.1-1.6-.4-2.4-.3-.7-.7-1.4-1.2-1.9-.5-.5-1.2-1-1.9-1.2-.8-.3-1.6-.5-2.5-.5h-7.2v17.9h3.6v-6h3.2c.9,0